//     Expr::{bvar,app,lam,pi}  ->  Expr::from_kind(kind)   (mod.rs:241)
//                              ->  kind.compute_meta()      (kind.rs:469)
//                              ->  ExprMeta::{mk_app_meta,mk_binder_meta}  (meta.rs)
//                              ->  mix_hash (MurmurHash2-64A) + the pack bit-ops
//
// CONSTRUCTING FN: `Expr::lift_at` (a direct-recursion de-Bruijn lift; the faithful
// WRITE analog of the already-verified `MicroExpr` Arc-WRITE `subst_at`/`lift0`, but
// over the REAL `Expr` whose `compute_meta` recomputes the bit-packed metadata word
