//   (the 10-arm dispatch), ExprMeta::{pack, mk_app_meta, mk_binder_meta, mk_let_meta,
//   loose_bvar_range, approx_depth, hash, has_*}, mix_hash (REAL Murmur arithmetic:
//   wrapping_mul by 0xc6a4a793..., lshr>>47, xor chain — NOT stubbed), KaniHasher
//   (clean's cfg(kani) pure-arithmetic hasher: new/finish/write_u8/u16/u32/u64),
//   Expr::{bvar,app,lam,pi}, Expr::meta, Expr::loose_bvar_range (>>44 extract),
//   checked_add_u32 (saturating_add), and the Arc/Box/Clone glue. The Arc::new
//   write side is `heap_alloc rust_heap i8, 56` (ArcInner = 16-byte counts + 40-byte
//   Expr) with the strong-count Store — the real heap construction, not a shim.
//
// MODELING (honest): the slice models clean's cfg(kani) VERIFICATION configuration.
