// mir_real_level_is_def_eq_roundtrip). The whnf slice is untouched, so
// whnf_impl's 115588-byte lowering is unaffected.
//
// Native oracle: `CuVerifier::def_eq` over `CuExpr`, whose Sort/Const embed the
// FULL `ClLevel` (reused from mir_real_level_is_def_eq_roundtrip — same enum the
// slice's Level was compiled from, so its 24-byte no-niche layout matches the JIT
// ABI by construction) and whose `level_eq`/`level_vec_eq` call `ClLevel::is_def_eq`
// (the REAL normalize). The Expr machinery mirrors CwExpr verbatim (renamed Cu*).
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

// Cu* Expr oracle: verbatim mirror of the CwExpr oracle (same variant ORDER ->
// discriminants match the JIT), with Sort/Const holding the FULL `ClLevel` and
// names reusing `ClName` (the slice unifies Level::Param's Name with Expr's Const/
// Proj/Let Name — one `Name(u32)` type; `ClName(u32)` matches its layout + Ord).
